# update_backups

`poggycore update <resource> apply` copies every file it replaces here first,
named `<resource>__<yyyymmdd-hhmmss>__<path with / as __>`.

It lives inside poggy_core because a server script may only write files in
its own resource. Delete old backups whenever you like. This README keeps
the folder present, since saving a file cannot create a missing folder.
